            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/README.md",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Rather than add a new one, I think we should update the documentation here and in Sensor.Value.  Any `Inventory.Item` should be able to be associated to the sensor in this way."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/README.md",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Janet Adkins",
                        "email": "janeta@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "jeaaustx"
                    },
                    "message": "I've removed the addition of this association. Per discord discussion this interface is going to be implemented using the existing all_sensors/chassis association."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Should this be a `set[enum[self.SensorPurpose]]`?  I know we only have one purpose right now but it seems likely to have more later."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Janet Adkins",
                        "email": "janeta@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "jeaaustx"
                    },
                    "message": "Added and adjusted descriptions to indicate there could be multiple purposes for a single sensor."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Should we be more explicit?  Should this be something like \"for the Inventory.Item associated to this sensor by the `monitoring` relationship\"?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Janet Adkins",
                        "email": "janeta@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "jeaaustx"
                    },
                    "message": "Per the discord discussion (https://discord.com/channels/775381525260664832/867820390406422538/1326614993768022087) will actually still be using the existing all_sensors association right now.\n\nFrom that discussion the long-term direction would be to switch to the monitoring/monitored_by association for all_sesnors/chassis connections. But that is technical debt to be worked separately.\n\nI'll add to this description to indicate the current use with a note on the future direction."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 33,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Any sensor item could be monitoring this (board would be the other example)."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 33,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "The association should go in the sensor and not in this object.  I'm pretty sure we already have an association of this name between any sensor and any Inventory.Item, which is sufficient here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Purpose.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 33,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Janet Adkins",
                        "email": "janeta@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "jeaaustx"
                    },
                    "message": "I'm removing this association definition per Patrick's comment."
                },
                {
